{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silent Watcher is a first-person psychological horror game with a short but intense experience, centered on tension, an oppressive atmosphere, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young woman waiting for your partner to return home. Night falls, and with it, a disturbing feeling that something\u2014or someone\u2014is watching you from the shadows. Every reflection, every sound, every corner seems to hide an invisible presence... one that refuses to be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to explore a home while surviving a silent stalker. There are no weapons. There is no combat. Only sound, your intuition, and environmental details will be your tools to resist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person narrative psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on exploration and role-playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements available for the most observant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interface available in English and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive soundtrack and sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to remain calm when you feel you are no longer alone?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sobreviviente","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843270/f812f82e7f260f05c5afdfd4af210d888cd9ea7e.jpg"},{"name":"Desconectado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843270/1055aa1810cd313ab64cce51d277c54eee7f96fb.jpg"},{"name":"De pedo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843270/1055aa1810cd313ab64cce51d277c54eee7f96fb.jpg"},{"name":"Encandilado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3843270/1055aa1810cd313ab64cce51d277c54eee7f96fb.jpg"},{"name":"Observador","path":"htt